      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Plan.get_sorted_tasks() = Kahn topological sort over integer dependencies (raises on a cycle).\ncurrent_task = first unfinished task in topo order (the deterministic pick).\nready_tasks = unfinished tasks whose deps are all finished-success (the frontier = the belief\npolicy's candidate set). WritePlan.update + merge_tasks revise this graph after each result.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "el1279",
      "originalText": "Plan.get_sorted_tasks() = Kahn topological sort over integer dependencies (raises on a cycle).\ncurrent_task = first unfinished task in topo order (the deterministic pick).\nready_tasks = unfinished tasks whose deps are all finished-success (the frontier = the belief\npolicy's candidate set). WritePlan.update + merge_tasks revise this graph after each result.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 15
    }
  ],
